  "content": {
    "id": "p10-q5-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "5",
    "prompt": "Use the remainder theorem to find the remainder when the polynomial $P(x)=x^3+2x^2-x+3$ is divided by:",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 3,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p10-q5-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$x-3$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$45$",
          "worked": "By the remainder theorem, the remainder is $P(3)$.\n$$\\begin{align*}P(3)&=3^3+2(3)^2-3+3\\\\P(3)&=27+18-3+3\\\\P(3)&=45\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 34
      },
      {
        "id": "p10-q5-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$x-\\dfrac{1}{2}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac{25}{8}$",
          "worked": "By the remainder theorem, the remainder is $P\\left(\\frac12\\right)$.\n$$\\begin{align*}P\\left(\\tfrac12\\right)&=\\left(\\tfrac12\\right)^3+2\\left(\\tfrac12\\right)^2-\\tfrac12+3\\\\P\\left(\\tfrac12\\right)&=\\tfrac18+\\tfrac12-\\tfrac12+3\\\\P\\left(\\tfrac12\\right)&=\\tfrac{25}{8}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 48
      },
      {
        "id": "p10-q5-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$x+\\dfrac{1}{2}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac{31}{8}$",
          "worked": "By the remainder theorem, the remainder is $P\\left(-\\frac12\\right)$.\n$$\\begin{align*}P\\left(-\\tfrac12\\right)&=\\left(-\\tfrac12\\right)^3+2\\left(-\\tfrac12\\right)^2-\\left(-\\tfrac12\\right)+3\\\\P\\left(-\\tfrac12\\right)&=-\\tfrac18+\\tfrac12+\\tfrac12+3\\\\P\\left(-\\tfrac12\\right)&=\\tfrac{31}{8}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 48
      }
    ]
  },
